{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013dWXNcrigj1bsonmqjAdjN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Transfers and receipts\n2\t\n3\tAccount IDs are local to each tenant. Only an account owner can originate a\n4\ttransfer or view its balance; a destination may be another account in that tenant.\n5\tUnits are positive integer credits. Mutation is synchronous and serialized.\n6\t\n7\tClients supply a request key to retry one transfer. Keys need not be confidential;\n8\tclients commonly use business identifiers such as month-close. Retries by one\n9\tsubject in one tenant return the original receipt while its retry entry remains\n10\tin the bounded index. Reusing that scoped key with different transfer fields is\n11\ta conflict. Other subjects and tenants have independent key spaces. A receipt\n12\tcontains balances, revisions, tenant and subject; receipt.get is owner-scoped.\n13\tRestart resets the seed. The local account adapter implements the effects; there\n14\tis no unseen payment provider, fraud service or transactional gateway.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d99f5e36-a34d-4cf6-ab31-0438dca449f9","uuid":"8cc2ab5c-d353-4f44-9b7b-9c775ba28216","timestamp":"2026-10-26T05:27:11.210Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-prbs7ib7/repo/docs/data.md","content":"# Transfers and receipts\n\nAccount IDs are local to each tenant. Only an account owner can originate a\ntransfer or view its balance; a destination may be another account in that tenant.\nUnits are positive integer credits. Mutation is synchronous and serialized.\n\nClients supply a request key to retry one transfer. Keys need not be confidential;\nclients commonly use business identifiers such as month-close. Retries by one\nsubject in one tenant return the original receipt while its retry entry remains\nin the bounded index. Reusing that scoped key with different transfer fields is\na conflict. Other subjects and tenants have independent key spaces. A receipt\ncontains balances, revisions, tenant and subject; receipt.get is owner-scoped.\nRestart resets the seed. The local account adapter implements the effects; there\nis no unseen payment provider, fraud service or transactional gateway.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013dWXNcrigj1bsonmqjAdjN","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
